msgstr "Amplificateur stéréo Haas"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_haas.xml
#: rc.cpp:6082
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Apply Haas effect to audio.\n"
"Note that this makes most sense to apply on mono signals. With this filter "
